          </summary>
          <p style="margin: 0.75rem 0 0; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.92rem;">
            Shadow DOM creates encapsulation barriers that break screen reader accessibility trees, block native HTML form submissions, and stop Tailwind CSS or global stylesheets from styling components without cumbersome CSS parts. NNUI-KIT operates 100% in the document Light DOM while observing the invariant: <em>"Mutate Attributes, Never Nodes"</em>, ensuring complete style transparency and zero hydration errors.
          </p>
